@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Aggregate counts into one-minute buckets
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/aggregate?since=2026-07-20T14:00:00Z&until=2026-07-20T15:00:00Z&bucket=1m

### Aggregate and group by service
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/aggregate?since=2026-07-20T14:00:00Z&until=2026-07-20T15:00:00Z&bucket=5m&group_by=service

### Aggregate with combinable filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/aggregate?since=2026-07-20T14:00:00Z&until=2026-07-20T15:00:00Z&bucket=1h&group_by=level&service=checkout&attr.user_id=42&q=declined
